This application is developed for the corresponding APP end of our official website ( shop.luvmehair.com ). Our product is a vertical segment of wigs, and our customers are mainly women who needs wigs/hair. The brand of our website is LUVME HAIR. This brand has a high reputation in the European and American markets. It has won praises from a large number of customers with high-quality products and services, and has strong customer stickiness and brand power. Therefore, we developed the APP that has a good customer experience and is easy to use, which will greatly improve the experience of our customers.

1. Support customers to browse products and information;
2. Support customers to add products to the shopping cart and place orders;
3. Support customer login and query account and order situation; 
4. Support customers to view official promotional information and so on;

Plan your purchases using the Shopping List Calculator app:
- a visit to the store will take twice less time because you already know what to buy;
- much less likely to spend money on something unnecessary, because you already have a clear list;

The application provides the ability to create a shopping list and automatically calculates the budget required for a trip to the store.
A user-friendly interface will help you add all the necessary items to your shopping list and indicate their price, which will allow you to see the approximate amount you will spend in the store.
The app contains more than 100 popular products, the approximate price of which is already listed, but you can adjust it. If the required product is not on this list, you can add any and specify its price yourself.

Main features:
- Does not require an Internet connection;
- Handy interface;
- Automatic budget calculation;
- More than 100 items with prices.

Thanks for downloading the app! We have a lot of cool ideas for future updates.
